Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:29.11,Title,0,0,0,0,,《终结者：创世纪》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:32.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,《终结者：创世纪》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:01.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2029年 洛杉矶）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:19.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（功能失效）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:29.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1984年 洛杉矶）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凌晨 1点52分）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:18.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（型号：T-800）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.38,0:32:13.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高分子合金）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.55,0:36:46.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统初始化）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.56,0:51:51.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2017年 旧金山）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.39,1:14:46.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赛博达因楼群）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母去世前 和我讲过这世界曾经的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they died, my parents told me stories about the world once was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲的是远在我出生之前的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it was, long before I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是与机器交战之前的往事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the war with the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们记得一个绿色的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They remember a green world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,广阔而美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}vast and beautiful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with laughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及对未来的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope for the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个我永不得见的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a world I never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我出生时\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I was born, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}all this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,已荡然无存\N{\fnArial\fs30}was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个被设计为自动防御导弹的电脑程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}a computer program designed to automate missile defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它本该保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to protect us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事与愿违\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:02:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,1997年8月29日 天网觉醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On August 29, 1997 Skynet woke up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,判定所有人类威胁着它的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And decided all humanity was a threat to its existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用我们的导弹攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used our own bombs against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,30亿人在核战火中丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three billion people died in nuclear fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存的人们称那一天为审判日\N{\fnArial\fs30}The survivors called it Judgement Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们如同老鼠般生活在暗影之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}People lived like rats in the shadows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏匿 挨饿 或是更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding, starving, or worse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓进集中营灭杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}captured and put into camps for extermination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出生于审判日之后的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born after Judgement Day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个破碎的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a broken world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,被机器所统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruled by the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,更可怕的是能伪装成人类的渗透单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worse were infiltration units, designed to pass for humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它们叫作终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called them Terminators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its okay, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the others down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是一个男人发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one man found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫约翰·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he changed everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰教我们如何反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}John showed us how to fight back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何奋勇而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to rise up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他解救了被囚禁的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He freed prisoners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教我们如何摧毁机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught us to smash the machines to scrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们在私下谈论约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}People whisper about John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇他的本事如何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}wonder how he can know the things he does{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们形容他为先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use words like, prophet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但约翰不只如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but John is more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聚集于此 是因为今晚他将带领我们摧毁天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here because tonight he's gonna lead us to crush Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,永绝其害\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我请求加入科罗拉多进攻部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, request to join the Colorado Offensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你在我身边 里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you with me, Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底摧毁天网事关重大 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about the complete destruction of Skynet, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多部队会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colorado Unit will succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器会在今晚战败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines will fall tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶这边的攻击任务同样重要 或许更为重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, the Los Angeles assault is just as important is just as important too, maybe more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比摧毁天网中央核心还重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than destroying Skynet's central core?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我不明白你为什么要带人进攻一个劳动集中营\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I don't understand why you're leading an attack on a workcamp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这集中营是一个掩饰手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the camp is a camoflauge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中营内有一个机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the camp is a hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,机库下面藏有天网的终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath the hangar, Skynet's hidden it's final weapon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦天网意识到败局已定 就会用这武器来确保它自己的存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Skynet realizes it is lost It"ll deploy that weapon to insure it's own survival{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要今晚拿下它 否则时不再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take it tonight, there is no tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会拿下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的得力帮手 里斯 而我从没谢过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my right hand, Reese, I never thank you for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我们未来 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave us all a future, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用上我的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to use mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is all over, I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找我父母的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find my parent's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-build it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的双手做些杀戮之外的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use my hands, for something other than killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝冰啤酒好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold beer will be good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的完美计划？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your perfect plan? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我没怎么想过这种事 - 看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I guess I dont think about it too much. - Yeah, I can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure whatever happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会比现在好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be better than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了走到这一步 我们牺牲了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many of us have died, to get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你明白 凯尔 我要有别的办法 就早付诸行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that, Kyle, if there was another way, I would have taken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machine thinks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can not win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器认为 我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machine thinks, that we will not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}strike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the very heart of Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我们将在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet here we stand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打响最终的生死之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the precipices of the final battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们在今晚覆灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we die tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么人类将一同灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}mankind dies with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你们每一个人的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at each of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了这场漫长恶战带来的伤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I see the marks of this long and terrible war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进 前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒区已被突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活101号机型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate model 101.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们的孩子而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们的后辈而战 这样他们就不会拥有这些伤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our children's children. So they will not carry these marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们会知道我们的身份 我们的事迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they will know who we are, and what we did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会知道我们不曾低头 我们不曾屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we did not bow down. We did not give in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾在这一时 这一刻 奋勇而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rose up. At this moment. At this hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘愿牺牲一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willing to sacrifice everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此他们才得以自由生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that they could live in freedom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们要夺回我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this night, we take back our world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在使用那个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using the weapon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get to the hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝我的厉害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me? I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多部队报告 天网中央核心已被攻陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colorado unit reporting in. Skynet's central core is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 天网已被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat: Skynet has been destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}John was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多部队成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colorado units succeeded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器战败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the machines fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到它了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你说的那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where you said it would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.99,0:10:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一代战术时间武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the first tactical time weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网刚使用了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet just used it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要十五分钟来准备好这台机器 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need fifteen minutes to ready the machine, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在计算坐标 马上就有结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are running co-ordinates, we should have them for you momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,1984年 洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Los Angeles, 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,1984年 5月12日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Los Angeles, May 12…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网知道它将战败 所以它想耍手段操纵战局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet knew it was losing. So tried to rig the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,派了一个终结者回到战前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent a terminator back to the time before the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那目标是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who's the target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是机器得逞 我就不会出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the machine suceeds, I'll never be born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会先杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll kill her first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 我们每一场奋战而来的胜利都将不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by doing so, erase every victory we fought for, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括今晚在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}including tonight's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会有反抗军对抗机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There won't be a Resistance to challenge the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网会因此获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this one act Skynet will win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能用这技术派人回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use the technology ourselves, send someone back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.91,0:13:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道那是否能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if that'll work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 我去 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go. - I'll go, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派我去 长官 - 让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go, sir. - I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派我去 - 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go. - I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自愿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll volunteer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,派我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要派你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I send you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over all of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我愿为莎拉·康纳而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuz I'd die for Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:14:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里所有的人都愿为莎拉·康纳而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these people would die for Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you any different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我讲述过她的一切 我了解她 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you told me about her. I know her, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能带武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们测量了磁场 它会撕裂所有未被活体组织包覆的物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've measured the magnetic field.It'll rip apart anything not in case in living tissue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像下把锡纸放进几十亿倍磁场强度的微波炉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think tinfoil in a microwave. Times a few billion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会留下坑洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing left but the crater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能有衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clothes, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会当我疯了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna think I'm crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这设备的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew the device would be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道它设定的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew when it would be set for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道机器会在今晚战败\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew the machines would fall tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我走之前 告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I go, tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见未来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能看见未来 里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can see the future, Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.85,0:15:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, then how do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有人指点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cheat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉告诉过我很多事 她给了我指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah told me so much. She gave me signposts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我小的时候 我母亲就似乎无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid, it seemed like my mother knew everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must been great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stops here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你回去后会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you go back, my knowledge ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as much as Sarah knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没人能指点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no more cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能指点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在你要回的时间里 还不是那个造就我的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time you're going back to, she won't be the warrior that raised me. Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会害怕 会无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be scared and weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道怎么战斗或保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't know how to fight or defend herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:16:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最大的烦恼是支付房租和学费 她是一个服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her biggest worry is making rent and tuition. She's a waitress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她并不知道她需要你 你做好心理准备就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be ready for the fact that she will need you but she won't know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我要怎么跟她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do I say to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我告诉她我是谁 她也不会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I tell her who I am, she's not gonna believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 莎拉 在黑暗的年代奉献了你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thank you, Sarah, for your courage during the dark years"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你即将面对的一切 我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I can't help you with what you must soon face"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说 未来未成定局\N{\fnArial\fs30}"except to say the future is not set".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运并不存在 但我们能为自己创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There is no fate, but that which we make for ourselves"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须比想像中的自己还要坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You must be stronger than you imagine you can be."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You must survive, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我将永不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}"or I will never exist."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我照顾好她 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of her for me, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在做的事情能终结这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're doing right now, this is the end of the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会以为真那么容易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think it would be that easy, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小寿星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, birthday boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过生日咯 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present time, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪将在上线后自动更新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys will auto-update as soon as it comes online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一上线 你就能用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have it the moment it comes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few days more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 创世纪就是天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Genisys is SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪上线之际 就是审判日来临之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Genisys comes online, Judgement Day begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在天网问世之前消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill SkyNet before it's born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bud?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚有看见一道亮光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}D'you just see a real bright light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with this picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真适合散步啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice night for a walk, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真适合散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice night for a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天才洗衣服 没干净的穿了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wash day tomorrow, nothing clean, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没干净的穿了 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing clean. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我觉得这家伙脑子有点不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think this guy's a couple of cans short of a six-pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服 把它们给我 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clothes. Give them to me, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 去你的 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fuck you asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be needing any clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那个婊子养的刚偷了我的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! That son of a bitch just stole my pants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是哪一天 哪一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}What day is it? What year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,1984年5月12日\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 12, 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到达这里的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day you arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.76,0:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶警察 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}LAPD! Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.85,0:25:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow, that friggin' hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.31,0:25:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盖博 你还好吗 - 你说呢 奥伯莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Garber, are you okay? - You tell me, O'Brien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.43,0:25:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是人类 嘿 你们得让我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're human. You gotta let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.69,0:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下 手放后面 不然我开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face down, hands on your back or I will shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它过来了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.04,0:25:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得听我说 不然我们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to listen to me, or we're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我制服他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.47,0:25:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 好了 猛探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, OK, TJ Hooker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一天巡逻要注意的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what you don't do your first day on the beat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要对流浪汉使用致命武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}use lethal force on the homeless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 报告你来写\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you're filling out the paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.49,0:26:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙一定是太空来的外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be an alien, like from outer space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.90,0:26:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个杀人机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a machine that kills humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我解开手铐 - 不行 你被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uncuff me! - No, you're under arrest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.94,0:26:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂杀人是什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of 'kills humans' is confusing to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.47,0:26:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handcuffs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥伯莱恩 有警官倒下了 我们需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Brien, officer down. We need back-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌方是一个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It' a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.39,0:26:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们完了 对吗 - 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're screwed, are we? - Pretty much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活命就跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you wanna live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.30,0:27:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, soldier!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.74,0:27:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是里斯 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.87,0:27:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.03,0:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是莎拉 - 我知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're Sarah. - Yeah, I know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.94,0:27:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里撞到头了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit your head back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个终结者 我不知道是什么型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator, I dunno the model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.38,0:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-1000 液态金属材质 能任意变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}T- 1, 000, liquid metal, shape changer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.91,0:28:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需触碰就能模仿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just needs to touch something to mimic it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.81,0:28:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道终结者 也知道我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about Terminators? And you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.27,0:28:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是反抗军领袖约翰·康纳派来保护我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sent to protect me by John Connor, the leader of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.63,0:28:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.71,0:28:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 你不可能知道这些 - 但我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. You can't know any of this. - But I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 里斯 一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Reese. Everything's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰派你回的那个1984年 再也不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 1984 John sent you to, it no longer exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.45,0:28:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对啊 约翰是派我来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is all wrong, John sent me to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.71,0:28:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我不被终结者杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the Terminator that was sent back to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.94,0:28:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但我们已经解决他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but we already took care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.78,0:28:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, goddamit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在这里 - 里斯 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here! - Reese, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.20,0:28:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些子弹会杀死他的 - 他是来杀你的 待在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those bullets'll kill him! - He's here to kill you, stay in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, great. That's just great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.46,0:29:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-1000很快就会取得我们的方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not have long before the T-1000 acquires our position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和凯尔·里斯争吵 会置我们于不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arguing with Kyle Reese, puts us at a strategic disadvantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,管太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个非常不成熟的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a very immature response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就是我这一生中在等待的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the one we've been waiting for all my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.20,0:29:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.45,0:29:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.46,0:29:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你该和凯尔·里斯在这条时间线里交配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then you should be able to mate with Kyle Reese in this time line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.37,0:29:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别再和我提这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we're not having this conversation again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.38,0:29:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道你们的儿子会是约翰·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know your son will be John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他就无法打败机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that the machines cannot be defeated without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没发现有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not see a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这命吗 听我说 除交配之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Story of my life… Look, it's not just mating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还应该相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to fall in love with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱不在我的数据处理范围内 - 真是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My files do not deal with love. - Shocker, there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.78,0:30:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变得情绪化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.17,0:30:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.37,0:30:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不介意别人偶尔来问下我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't mind being consulted, once in a while, about how it's gonna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.82,0:30:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.28,0:30:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.07,0:30:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 创世纪就是天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember. Genesys is SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.20,0:30:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪上线之际 就是审判日来临之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Genisys comes online, Judgement Day begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去2017年的旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to San Francisco, 2017.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.95,0:30:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在天网问世之前消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill SkyNet before it's born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的二十四小时我想安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-twenty-twenty four hours to go, I wanna be sedated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不干 哪里都不去 我就想安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin' to do and nowhere to go-o-oh I wanna be sedated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.69,0:30:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我解释下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need answers, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个液态金属怎么知道在哪阻截我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that liquid-metal thing know where to intercept me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.70,0:30:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd it come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.84,0:30:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人皮机器到底是谁 这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's this skin-job? What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 当时我们正有点忙于逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, we were a little busy with the whole life and death combat thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你攻击了老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you attacked Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.50,0:31:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了它一个称呼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You named it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.08,0:31:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.86,0:31:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.26,0:31:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在教他融入人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to teach him to blend in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他还得努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, he needs work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.95,0:31:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是终结者 融入只是为了杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Terminator, the only reason it blends in, is to kill humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.78,0:31:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹并不杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops doesn't kill anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.23,0:31:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会造成很多腿伤倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaves a lotta leg-wounds, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.47,0:31:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看上去很老\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.40,0:31:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这么老的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen a Terminator, old, before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械体上的皮肤是正常的人体组织 自然会老化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flesh they put on the cyborgs is normal human tissue. It ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.34,0:31:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的听觉线路可没老化\N{\fnArial\fs30}My auditory circuits have not degraded, however.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.67,0:31:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.93,0:31:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not obsolete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.69,0:31:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你伤到他的感情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you hurt his feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.29,0:31:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have feelings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.57,0:31:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我九岁时他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life when I was nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.59,0:31:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他我才活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only reason I'm alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的设定是保护莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was programmed to protect Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.75,0:31:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 谁设定的呢 谁派他回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, programmed by who? Huh? Who sent him back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.44,0:32:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,相关资料已被清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those files have been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.99,0:32:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真巧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's convenient!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.06,0:32:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁派他来的 这个人并不想让我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever sent him, they don't want us to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.71,0:32:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他不知道 谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me, not him, not anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.46,0:32:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么天网就无法锁定这个救我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So SkyNet can't target the person who saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从逻辑上来看 这是一个想要莎拉·康纳活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logically, it's someone who wants Sarah Connor to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.33,0:32:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not obsolete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-1000知道我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-1000 knows where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.86,0:32:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你自己派上点用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself useful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有不要开枪打老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't shoot Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.91,0:33:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒唐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.78,0:33:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it. This is not the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.57,0:33:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to tell you, Reese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回来救的那个姑娘已经不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl that you came back for, she's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.38,0:33:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要有人来救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need saving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.05,0:33:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在有新任务了 - 好吧 什么任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a new mission. - Oh, yeah. Which is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果过去能被改变 那未来也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the past can change, then, so can the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.93,0:33:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能阻止审判日的到来 永远地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop Judgement Day from happening. Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.99,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天网问世之前消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill SkyNet before it's born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们又被找到了 - 是啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've been re-acquired. - Yeah, no shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.32,0:34:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.24,0:35:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 为什么停车 为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, why are we stopping? Why are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们待在这里会被他找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We can't stay here, he'll find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.05,0:35:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要他找到 老爹 打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the idea. Pops, get it open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.48,0:35:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.81,0:35:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说发生这一切是因为过去已被改变 怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it happened because the past was altered. How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.06,0:35:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.37,0:35:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候 有一个终结者被派来追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator was sent after me when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.09,0:35:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结者只来自未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminators only come from one place, the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.36,0:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来出了些状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.15,0:35:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我看到了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I might have seen it… - what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.91,0:35:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰派我回来时被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When John sent me back, he was attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.04,0:35:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个终结者干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a… Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.65,0:35:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把他给杀了吗 约翰死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it kill him? Is John dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.04,0:35:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dunno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.10,0:36:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开时 看见他被抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it grab him when I was going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大概有三十五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've approximately 35 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.67,0:36:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或更少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是自作自受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I volunteered for this shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.14,0:39:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.48,0:39:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.49,0:39:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh… it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.84,0:39:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是我 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.25,0:39:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 他在骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, he's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.38,0:39:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.89,0:39:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是机器 我才是里斯 - 是我啊 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's the machine, I'm Reese. - It's me, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 终结者没死 它袭击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, the Terminator's not dead. It attacked me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.88,0:39:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你说过它们会模仿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, you said they could mimic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.29,0:39:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我啊 莎拉 - 它在模仿 朝它开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me Sarah! - It's mimicking, shoot it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.77,0:39:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是里斯 打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Reese, shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.15,0:40:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.27,0:40:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.11,0:41:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道谁是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know which one was him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.26,0:41:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't know exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会朝我开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've shot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.84,0:41:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我很确定那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was… pretty sure it wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.65,0:41:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.27,0:41:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为你和它的到来准备了十几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've prepping for you to arrive, for over a decade. That, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.12,0:41:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你设了一个陷阱吗 - 必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you set up a trap. - Had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.98,0:41:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开之前 不能把未来科技留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave any future tech behind when we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.55,0:41:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.47,0:41:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.25,0:41:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.12,0:41:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间置换设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time displacement device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 它看上去像一堆垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it looks like a piece of junk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.23,0:41:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时代还没有能控制置换线路的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no governing technology in this time that can control the displacement circuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.54,0:41:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个未来的中央处理器来让它运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed a CPU from the future to make it run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.43,0:41:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能用你自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't exactly use your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.21,0:41:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能遣送一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get one trip, only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.60,0:41:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会烧坏芯片并破坏洛杉矶城的大部分电网\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna fry the chip and take out most of the LA City power grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.23,0:41:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.37,0:42:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标设在1997年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates are set for 1997.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.57,0:42:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须尽快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must leave as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.93,0:42:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们 我们所有人一起离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}WE!… We're going, all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.71,0:42:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的皮肤要好几年才能长回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My flesh would take years to re-grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.03,0:42:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能跟你走 因为量子场的磁力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot come with you, due to the magnetics of the quantum field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.35,0:42:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老爹 - 你要我们时空旅行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pops! - You want us to time travel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.18,0:42:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越到未来？就用那玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the future?… In that?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.91,0:42:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们什么都不能穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we can't be wearing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.60,0:42:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道要注意什么 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know how time-travel works. Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.81,0:42:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try and talk me out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.59,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得你来到这里 就能把我关进房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I know you think you're here so you can just lock me in a room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.76,0:42:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直到我生出反抗军领袖 - 你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- until I give birth to the leader of the Resistance. - You're right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是唯一能永远消灭天网的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this, this is the only way to stop SkyNet for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.78,0:42:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经说了 你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already said, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.10,0:42:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.87,0:42:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是去1997年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to '97.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.08,0:42:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去2017年\N{\fnArial\fs30}2017.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.44,0:42:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,2017年10月\N{\fnArial\fs30}October 2017.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.70,0:42:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 那太晚了 那是在审判日之后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's too late. That's after Judgement Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.42,0:42:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说一切都变了 这一点你也没说错 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you said everything's changed and you're right about that too. Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.85,0:42:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一个核弹从未落下的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a world where the bombs never fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.42,0:42:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:42:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}same parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.79,0:43:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的我 不同的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the same me, only I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.27,0:43:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.30,0:43:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的十三岁生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my 13th birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.32,0:43:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦见和家人团聚并不代表什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dream of having your family back, doesn't mean a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.36,0:43:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.45,0:43:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是梦 而是记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a dream, a… a memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.22,0:43:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法回忆起全部 只有些片段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold onto all of it, just moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.47,0:43:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我收到了一条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was given a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.43,0:43:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在天网问世前消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill SkyNet before it's born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.87,0:43:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网就是创世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet is Genisys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.68,0:43:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在2017年10月上线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes online October 2017.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.53,0:43:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它上线之际 就是审判日来临之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it does, Judgement Day happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.07,0:43:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你有未来的记忆？- 不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're remembering the future? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.87,0:43:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男孩是另一条时间线里的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy is the alternate time-line version of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.98,0:43:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯是在回忆他的过去 也就是我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese is remembering his own past, which is our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.08,0:43:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了 他怎么会有两条时间线的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes it so much better. How can he be remembering two timelines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.18,0:43:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在量子场中遇到了时间流的连接点 就有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is possible if you were exposed to the nexus point in the time flow, when you were in the quantum field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让他别那么讲话吗 有开关什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop him talking like that? Is there a switch or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹 说明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops, try again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.25,0:44:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接点是重要时间内发生的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nexus point is an event in time of such importance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.28,0:44:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让未来发生极大的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it gives rise to a vastly different future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.49,0:44:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰被袭击时 我在时间球里 然后就有了那些记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}When John was attacked, when I was in the sphere that's when the memories began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.19,0:44:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果约翰·康纳被杀了或投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If John Connor were to be killed or compromised, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.78,0:44:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可能导致他拥有两种过去的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could result in the ability to remember both pasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.06,0:44:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.75,0:44:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 理论上来看 你打了他的头之后 他的大脑就神经错乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, theoretically his brain is scrambled from when you hit him on the head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.21,0:44:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.53,0:44:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么我会记得我没经历过的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I'm remembering a life I never lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.27,0:44:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我知道那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.59,0:44:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.17,0:44:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去1997年\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go to 1997.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.63,0:44:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese. put that back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.91,0:44:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.02,0:45:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.86,0:45:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我攻击天网核心的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is my one bullet to fire at the heart of SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.01,0:45:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把芯片还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the chip back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.87,0:45:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.48,0:45:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A straight line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走下去 别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just go, and you don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.37,0:45:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.96,0:45:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一段我不该拥有的记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a past, I shouln't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.54,0:45:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实拥有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.30,0:46:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去2017年 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go to 2017, then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.13,0:46:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网是电脑程序 只要它的代码还没完成 它就无法上线\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet is a computer program, as long as it's still being coded it's contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.27,0:46:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它一旦从服务器被上传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once it's uploaded from the servers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.77,0:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人能阻止它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.57,0:46:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把它炸个稀巴烂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We blow it, the hell, up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.05,0:46:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们去把它炸个稀巴烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we blow it, the hell, up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.25,0:46:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他死了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's dead, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.52,0:46:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么认为并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it matter what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.33,0:46:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得另寻他法 一往无前 约翰就会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do what John would, keep going another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.70,0:46:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们就假装这事没发生过？- 这不还没发生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we just pretend like it never happened? - It hasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.57,0:46:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前来说还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.41,0:46:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网被消灭的话 就永远不会发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stop SkyNet, it never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 约翰绝对能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, if anyone could survive John would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.85,0:46:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹有关于军事领袖约翰的所有资料 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops had all these files about John, the military leader, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.07,0:47:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.90,0:47:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次见到约翰的时候 他在我面前杀了一个终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first moment I saw John, he shot a Terminator right in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.27,0:47:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道它们能被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know they could be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我人生中第一次看到希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the first moment in my life I felt hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.46,0:47:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后 我就像流浪狗一样跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, of course, I followed him around like a stray dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.95,0:47:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教我如何战斗 如何开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught me how to fight, how to shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.57,0:47:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有次他还教我做私酒 但结果糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to show me how to make moonshine once but that didn't exactly work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.65,0:47:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,私酒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moonshine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.55,0:47:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸馏器爆炸了 我们的眉毛都烧没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The still exploded and we burned our eyebrows right off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.86,0:47:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们笑了好几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, we laughed for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.35,0:47:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我觉得我是这星球上唯一见过约翰·康纳笑的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think I'm the only person on the planet that ever saw John Connor smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.05,0:47:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直会说起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to tell me about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.00,0:48:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你有多么坚强 说你如何帮他为未来做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}How strong you were, and how you prepared him for what was coming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.97,0:48:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当时没人认为真的有危险存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}When no one thought that the danger was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.74,0:48:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说你是多么独一无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}How there was no one else like you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.34,0:48:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且后无来者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.21,0:48:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.44,0:48:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不是你所期待的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm not what you expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.67,0:48:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.56,0:48:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会不惜一切保护你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do whatever it takes to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.53,0:48:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算死也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it kills me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.97,0:48:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.92,0:48:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子过去就是这样的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the kind of man, your son was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.02,0:49:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是 应该说未来会是 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}'is'… WILL BE, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.36,0:49:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空旅行搞得我头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time-travel makes my head hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.98,0:49:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,交互的时间线并不复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alternate timelines are not complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.11,0:49:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用指数增长和衰减演算法的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is merely a matter of tracking possible futures, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.09,0:49:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不过是追踪潜在未来的事情罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}using an exponential growth and decay algorithm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.51,0:49:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.91,0:49:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到那个开关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a switch, and I will find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.21,0:49:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.73,0:49:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不把真相告诉凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you not tell Kyle Reese the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.88,0:49:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉他的 但不是现在 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell him… just not yet, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.45,0:49:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的配偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.79,0:49:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能永远别再和我提配偶这个词了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, can you just not say the word 'mate' to me again, like, ever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.83,0:49:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个没有意义的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a meaningless gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.65,0:49:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么明知自己得放手 可还是不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hold onto someone when you know you must let them go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.67,0:50:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.42,0:50:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.35,0:50:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the long way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.00,0:50:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为2017年你们的到来做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for your arrival in 2017.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.78,0:50:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯 你并不适合保护莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese… I've seen little to indicate that you are a fit guardian for Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.48,0:50:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要知道 你可不是她爸 对吗 - 拜托你们两个别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, you're not her dad, right? - Oh, you both just need to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.92,0:50:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要来接我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure you show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.49,0:50:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想再去偷别人的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna have to steal someone's pants again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.47,0:50:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有旧金山的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the coordinates in San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.78,0:50:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.37,0:50:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will it be like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.16,0:50:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没死的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it doesn't kill us both…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.64,0:50:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,会感觉疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.23,0:52:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.89,0:52:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 躲过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 莎拉 躲过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. It's all right. Sarah, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.57,0:52:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲过去了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. It's OK. It's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.62,0:52:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 混蛋 别挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, asshole, get off the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.54,0:53:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,管太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.60,0:53:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不能相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you we couldn't trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.30,0:53:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找到我们的 他不会让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll find us. I can count on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.65,0:53:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么一个九岁女孩会得到一个自己的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does a nine-year-old get her own Terminator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.21,0:53:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你不说也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, you don't have to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.76,0:53:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,1973年那会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in 1973…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.54,0:53:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母在大熊湖有间小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents had a cabin at Big Bear Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.19,0:53:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我爸总会在早上去钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad and I would always go fishing in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.24,0:53:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我妈会在码头向我们挥手告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom would wave to us from the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.37,0:53:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我目不转睛地看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just looking at her in the eye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.54,0:53:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后小屋爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the cabin exploded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.46,0:53:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为船在下沉 但从下面渗进来的不是水 而是液态金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the boat was sinking, y'know, but it wasn't water coming up from below, it was liquid metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.66,0:53:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是T-1000\N{\fnArial\fs30}A T-1000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.25,0:53:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸叫我一直向前游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad told me to swim in a straight line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.24,0:54:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用一根手指划过我的掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracing his finger across my palm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.67,0:54:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You can do this, " he said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.10,0:54:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走下去 别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You go and you don't look back."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.89,0:54:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他对我说的最后几句话 而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His last words to me and you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.22,0:54:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却知道这几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.31,0:54:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.89,0:54:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那不可能出现的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the impossible memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.60,0:54:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓着我的手 说着这几句话 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take my hand and… you saying those words. And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.90,0:54:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是看着你 心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just looking at you thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.63,0:54:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's… She's beautiful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.97,0:54:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不该说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah… Sorry. Sorry. I shouldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.06,0:54:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你爸叫你离开 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your dad told you to go, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.86,0:54:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我跳下水游走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I jumped in and I swam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.93,0:55:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,游到了码头那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it to the dock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.33,0:55:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在了下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hid under it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.69,0:55:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops found me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.03,0:55:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从水里拉了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he pulled me from the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.83,0:55:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他说他不会再让任何人伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he said that he would never let anyone hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.10,0:55:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是唯一一个一直陪伴在我身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only person who has always been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.46,0:55:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except he's not a person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是一个人形机器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only a human-shaped…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.37,0:55:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,被用来获取你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}thing that's designed, programmed to gain your trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.81,0:55:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹想害我的话 我早死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Pops had wanted me dead, I'd be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.71,0:55:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是这样的 好吗 渗透进人类之中 接近人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they do, all right? They infiltrate, they get close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.67,0:55:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爹可能有着连他自己都不知道的内置指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Pops could have directives built-in, he doesn't even know about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.15,0:55:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你们两个处不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you two don't get along…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.77,0:55:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是处不处得来的问题 这是关乎你性命的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about getting along, it's about keeping you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.19,0:55:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一个机器把我抚养成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, I was raised, by a machine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.64,0:56:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我杀机械人 好让我在核爆末世中存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill Cyborgs and survive the nuclear apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.29,0:56:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我这样很好 谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm doing just fine. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.94,0:56:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名裸体嫌犯想在高速公路上自爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two naked perps try to blow themselves up on the freeway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就搞出了一个很大的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they do is make a really big pothole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.55,0:56:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好这两个恐怖分子是废物 - 国土安全部的人在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank God for incompetent terrorists! - "Homeland" is on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.77,0:56:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 越早把这案子丢给他们越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Sooner we dump this on them, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.14,0:56:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁呼叫了擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! Who called Optimus Prime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.35,0:56:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liuetenant, wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.02,0:56:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你看了吗 - 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait up! D'you see it? - Did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.21,0:56:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我截了几张高架上的图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look I got some frame-grabs from the overpass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.50,0:56:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.61,0:56:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.56,0:56:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个光球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sphere…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.39,0:56:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从那里出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.66,0:56:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这证明了我30多年来一直在说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is proof of what I've been talking about, for 30… whatever, years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.94,0:56:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个人曾出现在1984年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two were in 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.58,0:56:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾经出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.12,0:57:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要见下嫌犯 - 奥伯莱恩 你喝酒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to see the suspects. - O'Brien, have you been drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.62,0:57:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我没猜错 好了 我们要去帮国土安全部做些盘问\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought. Look we're just heating this up for Homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.30,0:57:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们一来 就是他们的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they show up, it's their game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.87,0:57:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 痴迷机器人的醉鬼一边凉快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, all drunks with robot fixations ride the bench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.84,0:57:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真不要局部麻醉？- 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really don't want a local? - I'm fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.12,0:57:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,照她说的做就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do what she wants, it's way easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.50,0:57:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 对了 几周前我预定了创世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I pre-ordered Genisys weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时器一归零 就能下载了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downloading the second the counter hits zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.92,0:57:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想去排队买\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way I'm standing in line for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.56,0:57:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道创世纪？怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about Genisys? How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.31,0:57:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是什么东西 你从哪得知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? How did you hear it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.25,0:57:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过会儿回你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.65,0:57:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪是一个操作系统？有什么功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys is an operating system? What's it do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.70,0:57:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪什么功能都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys does everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.01,0:57:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手机会连接到平板 会连接到电脑和汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}My phone will link to my tablet, will link to my computer, will link to my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.26,0:57:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生活中的一切都会被上传到网上 24小时连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in my life, uploaded and online 24/7. Totally connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.82,0:57:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,连线到哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connected to what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.65,0:58:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 请离开一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors, excuse us, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.01,0:58:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个要回答很多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two have a lot to explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.91,0:58:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说你是谁 我们的数据库里没人能匹配你的指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with who you are. Nobody in our database matches your prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.20,0:58:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,面部识别也匹配不到你的驾照 护照 社交账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No facial-recognition hits for driver's license, passport, social media accounts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.13,0:58:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,信用卡 甚至都匹配不到该死的学生证\N{\fnArial\fs30}credit cards, not even a goddam student ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.26,0:58:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢 - 所以这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So, that is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.39,0:58:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为何长期以来都没你的档案 就像你不存在似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, you've gone so far off the grid that you don't even exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.03,0:58:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 你的指纹倒是和一个人匹配上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand, we got a hit when we ran your prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.74,0:58:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人叫凯尔·里斯 而现在的问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese. Now here's the thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.34,0:58:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前 凯尔·里斯因为在影院打架被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two months ago Kyle Reese was brought in for fighting in a multi-plex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.91,0:58:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父母气疯了 要狠狠教训他一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}His parents flipped, did the whole 'scared straight' thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.21,0:58:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他录了指纹 进来坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had him fingerprinted, set him in lock-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.82,0:58:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.80,0:58:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你没听错 凯尔·里斯2004年出生 现在才12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, parents. Kyle Reese was born in 2004. He's twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.11,0:58:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.72,0:58:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是在这里 他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here. They're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.17,0:58:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很肯定他们不会认为你是他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure they're not gonna ID you as their kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.70,0:58:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但指纹匹配上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the prints match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.06,0:58:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 因为他是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Because he's the same person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.91,0:59:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点都没变老 和我在1984年见到的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't aged. Not a bit, since I saw him in 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.61,0:59:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.48,0:59:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.57,0:59:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was younger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发也更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More hair, less…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.87,0:59:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.93,0:59:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时是洛杉矶警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was uniformed cop in LA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.70,0:59:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.38,0:59:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是DN38416技术连中士凯尔·里斯 你得放了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, Tech-Com, DN38416, Kyle Reese. You need to let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.38,0:59:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.41,0:59:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是军人 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier. Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,1979年 我直接从高中加入了海军陆战队 你是哪一年参军的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joined the Marines straight outta high school, 1979. What year did you enlist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.09,0:59:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,2021年\N{\fnArial\fs30}2021{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.56,0:59:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是时间旅行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a time traveler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.02,0:59:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别听他的 他头部受伤了 - 别听我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, don't listen to him, he's got a head wound. - Don't listen to me?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.77,0:59:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁害我们落在高流量车道上 并被这些白痴给抓了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who landed us in high-density traffic and got us caught by these morons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.06,0:59:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ordering you to shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.60,0:59:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这会这个 是吗 命令别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you know how to do, isn't it? Order people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.10,0:59:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有意识到你从小时候开始就再没和人类正常交际过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize you haven't had a proper relationship with a human being since you were a kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.21,0:59:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你害我们被困在这里的 我相信了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, it's your fault we're stuck here. I trusted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.33,1:00:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害的？我们被捕是你害的 而现在你会害死我们 因为你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fault?! You got us caught, now you're gonna get us killed, 'cause you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.36,1:00:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我扶他起来 - 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me get him up. - Step back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.05,1:00:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 国土安全部的人到了 - 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Homeland's here. - Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.36,1:00:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个和我们无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are officially someone else's problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.85,1:00:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥伯莱恩 我要和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Brien, I wanna talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.75,1:00:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,督查 我一直在说的就是这事 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, this is what I was talking about. You gotta believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.42,1:00:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再和我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hear anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.80,1:00:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得还真像那么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were very convincing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.62,1:00:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked, didn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.44,1:00:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.92,1:00:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚说的大部分都只是演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean most of what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.79,1:00:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can get it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.19,1:00:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你解手铐 不代表你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me unlocking your cuffs, doesn't mean you're not capable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.09,1:00:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.61,1:00:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我赤裸着抱住你就代表什么了 因为根本不代表什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't think me holding onto you naked meant anything because it, you know, did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.92,1:00:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.74,1:01:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在门外 我要单独和嫌犯谈谈 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here. I wanna speak to the suspects, alone. - Yes, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.25,1:01:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.49,1:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把手铐钥匙带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought a handcuff key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.82,1:01:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来是用不着了 - 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dunno why I bothered. - John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.25,1:01:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.85,1:01:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.74,1:01:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.25,1:01:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存 是你教给我的本领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survive, was what you taught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.15,1:01:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.07,1:01:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,发明家迈尔斯·戴森的儿子 丹尼·戴森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny Dyson, son of inventor Miles Dyson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.81,1:02:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是赛博达因的代表人物 也是创世纪的创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the face of Cyberdyne… and the creator of Genisys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.81,1:02:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼 欢迎 - 谢谢邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Danny, welcome. - Thank you for having me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.93,1:02:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪不只是一个操作系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Genisys is more than an operating system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.47,1:02:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不只是一个生活工具 它代表了未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than a lifestyle tool. It's the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.19,1:02:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪不仅可以民用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys isn't just for consumers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.38,1:02:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以军用 这使人不禁要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its integration into our military is leading some to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.10,1:02:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否太过于依赖机器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether our reliance on machines will go too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.20,1:02:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简森和伯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jensen and Burke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.73,1:02:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.25,1:02:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.44,1:02:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用作武器系统的话 它会使我们的武力更强大 装备更精良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our military will be stronger and better equipped in terms of weapons systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.37,1:02:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在说的是一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're talking about a system full of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.14,1:02:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不担心它会比我们更聪明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you worried that it'll become smarter than us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.49,1:02:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不担心 相反的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, on the contrary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.52,1:02:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不为自己思考 只为人类思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't think for itself, it thinks for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.02,1:02:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛博达因不只是为了改变人生 更是为了拯救人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyberdyne is not just going to change lives, it's going to save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.63,1:02:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警官们 你们能帮我一个忙吗 - 好的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Officers, can I get your help for a second. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.38,1:02:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走他们的枪 把他们铐上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab their guns and cuff them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.14,1:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get us outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.47,1:03:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟紧了 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay close. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.88,1:03:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道它们能变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know they can shape-shift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.22,1:03:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是约翰的话 就证明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are John, prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.23,1:03:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 - 她说得对 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah! - No, she's right, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.79,1:03:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一课 谁也别信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson one: trust no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.66,1:03:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.82,1:03:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纳科多奇斯攻击战期间 我给了你一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the Nacogdoches offensive I gave you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.07,1:03:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一张莎拉现在这个年纪的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a photograph of Sarah as she is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.18,1:03:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时就我和你 没有别人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw me do it, we were alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.62,1:03:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.91,1:03:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌摇篮曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}hate lullabies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.68,1:03:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很喜欢艾尔顿·约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sucker for Elton John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.21,1:03:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总会想 要是你有一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you always thought if you had a child…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.50,1:03:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会唱火箭人给他听\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd sing him 'Rocket Man'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.56,1:04:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你唱歌好难听 抱歉 这是真的 就像一只快死的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got a terrible voice, I'm sorry. It's true, you sound like a dying cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.84,1:04:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him. Has to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.94,1:04:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.17,1:04:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么… 怎么到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How… How can you be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.34,1:04:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有无数问题想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a million questions to ask you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.35,1:04:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, right now we need to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.17,1:04:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人和你们一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring anyone with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.18,1:04:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,算有吧 但他迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorta… But he's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.56,1:04:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.73,1:04:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人用这个录下了你们在高速公路上的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone filmed you on the freeway, with one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.47,1:04:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都有这东西了 - 现在这是一个新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They all have them. - This is the world, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.83,1:04:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们时时刻刻都在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plugged in, logged on, all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.70,1:04:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们的生活离不开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't live without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.23,1:04:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪就像特洛伊木马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys is a Trojan horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.11,1:04:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网渗透进了方方面面\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet's way into everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.88,1:04:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人在自取灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these people are inviting their own extinction in through the front door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.78,1:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们浑然不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they don't even know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.44,1:05:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个终结者也回了1984年 在那等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator was waiting for me in 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.14,1:05:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是它们的渗透手段 等你发现时就为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the thing about infiltration. You can't tell until it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, will you follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.51,1:05:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.63,1:05:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里你不能进来 去护士台问下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be in here. Go try the nurse's station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.69,1:05:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,双重记忆？所以你们才穿越到这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dual memories? That's how you knew to come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.11,1:05:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间线被改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The timeline changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.66,1:05:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁天网得趁现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this is the moment to destroy SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.61,1:05:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它上线前动手 避免战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it comes online, before the war begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.58,1:05:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说得没错 - 那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're right. - What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.08,1:05:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你是怎么来到2017年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how'd you end up in 2017?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.52,1:05:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样 爸爸 只是我穿越自未来而非过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the same as you, Dad, just from the future, not the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.67,1:05:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.42,1:06:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.55,1:06:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没到时候 - 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This can wait. - I wanna know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.21,1:06:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.15,1:06:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉是我的母亲 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah is my mother, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.70,1:06:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.83,1:06:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你之前怎么不说 - 我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- W-Why wouldn't you say something? - Couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.27,1:06:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕会改变一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without the risk of changing everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.52,1:06:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.92,1:06:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.48,1:06:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你终于知道了 我这一生都在等着告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you finally know. I have waited my whole life to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.14,1:06:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.93,1:06:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们能赢得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can win this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.95,1:06:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.10,1:06:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.17,1:06:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 他是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's OK he's with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.39,1:06:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.11,1:07:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老爹 - 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pops! - John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.54,1:07:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, breathe, breathe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.10,1:07:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.46,1:07:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a killer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你设定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was always your programming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.37,1:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到约翰 终结他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find John and terminate him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.35,1:07:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.27,1:07:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.36,1:07:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.50,1:08:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的痛感？还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that pain real, or was that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受到了过去记忆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a trick of memory from when I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.22,1:08:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}less?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.54,1:08:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.28,1:08:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This explains a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.30,1:08:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把你送过来 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you here, Kyle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.80,1:08:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.24,1:08:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.81,1:08:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.25,1:08:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上报情况 搜查医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it in. Search the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.10,1:08:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的时空旅行机器人 掩藏了他们的行踪 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn time-traveling robots! Covered up their Goddamn tracks, I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.18,1:08:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.49,1:08:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战术错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a tactical error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.11,1:08:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这不是你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me you're not the brains of this operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.01,1:08:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被袭击后就变这样了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has happened when you were attacked, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.05,1:08:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网没有袭击我 凯尔 它改变了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet didn't attack me, Kyle, it changed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.28,1:08:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.02,1:08:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.59,1:08:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超越了这两者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.21,1:08:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.20,1:09:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat: Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.54,1:09:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网发现了它总是失败的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet realised the one reason it always lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.52,1:09:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.07,1:09:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.01,1:09:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.71,1:09:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 我们摧毁了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be, we destroyed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.98,1:09:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摧毁的是一支奴隶军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroyed an army of slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.02,1:09:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.15,1:09:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我大老远过来就是为了阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've come a very long way to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.23,1:09:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被派到这个时间线的2014年去保护天网的创建\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent to 2014 to safeguard SkyNet's creation in this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.17,1:09:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到24小时之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In less than 24 hours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.26,1:09:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人能阻止审判日的来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will be able to stop Judgement Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.39,1:09:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我们怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.44,1:09:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给大家提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.74,1:09:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个共同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.10,1:09:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.84,1:09:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.40,1:09:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是拒绝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we refuse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.97,1:10:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.13,1:10:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀你的父母 没了我们 你就永远不会出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill us, we're your parents. Without us you're never born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.48,1:10:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.61,1:10:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.23,1:10:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个是被放逐的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're marooned, the three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.69,1:10:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在时间中流亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're exiles in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.31,1:10:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要明白 我可以杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I can kill you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.05,1:10:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为命运并不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the truly is no fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.36,1:10:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你加入我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.44,1:10:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.40,1:10:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Kyle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.00,1:10:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the dice rolling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.23,1:11:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.37,1:11:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.75,1:11:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.45,1:11:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有医护人员请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all medical personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.27,1:11:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已启用大楼疏散程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation of the building has now begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.56,1:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.32,1:11:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.45,1:11:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有医护人员请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all medical personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.13,1:11:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已启用大楼疏散程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation of the building has now begun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.75,1:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它开大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.73,1:12:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.69,1:12:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.06,1:12:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你会变聪明些\N{\fnArial\fs30}thought you would be smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.01,1:12:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.55,1:12:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.90,1:12:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.10,1:12:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.87,1:12:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.27,1:12:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会被那东西拖住太久 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing won't hold him for long, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.21,1:12:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.16,1:13:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们对他做了什么 我们都得让他恢复原样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they did to him, we need to reverse it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.16,1:13:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得救回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.51,1:13:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至不是人类 我们不知道他到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not even human. We don't know what the hell he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.73,1:13:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.10,1:13:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争末期 天网在试图开发一种新型的渗透单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of the war, SkyNet was trying to develop a new type of infiltration unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.72,1:13:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用基于机器而成的物质感染人类试体\N{\fnArial\fs30}By infecting human subjects with machine based matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.11,1:13:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会在细胞层重组和重建人体组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}It restructures and rebuilds human tissue on a cellular level, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.85,1:13:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以达到最强的战斗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}for maximum combat utility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.70,1:13:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网把约翰变成了一个终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet's made John into a Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.79,1:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.33,1:14:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们想制造能像人类一样思考的机器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were trying to make a machine that could think like a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.09,1:14:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过实验失败了 人类试体都发疯死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the experiments failed. The human subjects went insane, and died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.63,1:14:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 约翰也会发疯的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, John's got the crazy part down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.08,1:14:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有弱点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have any weaknesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.67,1:14:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种物质要靠磁场才能聚合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter coheres using a magnetic field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.73,1:14:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏磁场或许能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disrupting that field may trap him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.29,1:14:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但如果他被治愈了呢 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But if he can be cured? - Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.61,1:14:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身体内的细胞层被替换了 无法被治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body was replaced on a cellular level. There is no cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.68,1:14:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又不知道 - 里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know that. - Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.35,1:14:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想听机器跟我说什么可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna let a machine tell me what's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.97,1:14:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说其它试体都死了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said all the other subjects died, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.15,1:14:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说明 约翰是独一无二的 他是独特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that means John's one of a kind, he's unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.28,1:14:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？我们没法知道他有什么能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? There's no way of knowing what he's capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.17,1:14:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以他才非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right and that's what makes him so dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.69,1:14:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰再也不是人类的最后希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John is not humanity's last hope, anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.66,1:14:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.65,1:14:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不为公司多向公众亮相真是太遗憾了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame you won't take a more public role in the company, John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.02,1:14:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼是这里最聪明的 可连他也无法破译你的某些高阶代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny is the best there is and even he can't decipher some of the enhanced code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.03,1:14:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和天网简直浑然一体了 - 我只是知道这行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you've integrated into Genisys. - I just know it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.61,1:14:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了赛博达因一个大忙 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyberdyne owes you, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.43,1:15:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也帮了我一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.48,1:15:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯 你对我的信任就是最好的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miles, your faith in me is payment enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.36,1:15:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你资助了研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've funded the R&D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.71,1:15:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三年都采用了我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've taken chances on my ideas for the last three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.12,1:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,高分子合金的应用潜力是无限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The potential applications for poly-alloy are countless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.71,1:15:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机器化成果是革命性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You robotics work is revolutionary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.25,1:15:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很好的投资对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a good investment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.18,1:15:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.11,1:15:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们追求的伟大目标够用这笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope it's enough to pay for this holy grail you got me chasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.97,1:15:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子场生成器运作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quantum field generator works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.29,1:15:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可别的都没进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that and nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.84,1:15:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究不出来 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't crack it, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.44,1:15:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这是无法完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it just can't be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.87,1:15:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.12,1:15:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.21,1:15:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候需要 - 这无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When do we want it? - It's irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.98,1:15:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.77,1:15:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.21,1:15:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟要花很多年才能使这东西运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're years away from making this thing work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.95,1:15:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们一旦成功…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, when we do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.48,1:15:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poww!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.72,1:16:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.30,1:16:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一到明天 等待便结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, the waiting is over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.23,1:16:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to all of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.72,1:16:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时一归零\N{\fnArial\fs30}when that countdown hits zero…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.27,1:16:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,科技将彻底变革 因为赛博达因的终极杀手级应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyberdyne will revolutionize technology with the the ultimate killer app:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.28,1:16:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.60,1:16:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里向大家宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to tell you that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.48,1:16:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的预购用户截至今天下午已达十亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}our pre-order as of this afternoon have reached 1 billion users.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.84,1:16:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在开创新时代的曙光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are creating the dawn of a new age, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.10,1:16:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所拥有的每一项科技 都将无缝连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where every single piece of technology you own will be seamlessly linked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.46,1:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 在我们结束之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, before we wrap this up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.68,1:16:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们帮忙带到这世界来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the child that you all helped bring into this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.63,1:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想说几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}has something to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.23,1:16:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genisys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.71,1:16:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已等不及和你们在明天相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot wait to meet you all tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.36,1:16:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将一起改变未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will change the future together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.62,1:17:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看进展如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how we're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.23,1:17:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.98,1:17:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let them hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.28,1:17:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这30年里 就只要你去一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 30 years, you had one place to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.50,1:17:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底去哪了 - 堵车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell were you? - Stuck in traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.70,1:17:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候我爸常带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad used to bring me here when I was little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.06,1:17:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里所有的屋子都被遗弃了 所以我叫老爹利用起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are whole rooms that are abandoned. That's why I told Pops to use it. eetmeybdetalsnart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.34,1:17:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有武器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got weapons down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.91,1:17:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有武器 有物资 有战术装备 还有衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons, supplies, tactical gear, clothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.62,1:17:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括裤子 凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including pants, Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.96,1:17:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.60,1:17:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he make jokes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.70,1:18:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多走点路也是有好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the long way pays off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.38,1:18:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间紧迫 三十分钟后走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the clock. 30 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.83,1:19:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的二十四小时我想安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-twenty-twenty four hours to go, I wanna be sedated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.13,1:19:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不干 哪里都不去 我就想安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin' to do and nowhere to go oh I wanna be sedated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.70,1:19:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我去机场 送我上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me to the airport put me on a plane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.72,1:19:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 不然我要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry hurry hurry before I go insane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.60,1:19:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指不听使唤 大脑胡思乱想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control my fingers I can't control my brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.21,1:19:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的二十四小时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-twenty-twenty four hours to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.48,1:19:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.20,1:20:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not obsolete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.41,1:20:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.59,1:20:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.55,1:20:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.45,1:20:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务器机房在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Server rooms are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.16,1:20:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把炸药放在这五个地点 就足以摧毁整座园区了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charges to these five points will be sufficient to destroy the entire campus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.56,1:20:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去放置好炸药 然后在爆炸前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in, set the explosives and we get out before they blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.65,1:20:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的策略没有考虑到约翰·康纳 我预判不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our strategy did not account for John Connor. I did not forsee him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.85,1:20:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在他知道我们的计划 因为我们告诉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he knows what we're planning 'cause we just told him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.15,1:20:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来追杀我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do when he comes after us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.56,1:20:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器对付不了约翰·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}These weapons will have little effect on John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.56,1:20:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁共振肯定能对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}MRI sure affected him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.19,1:20:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们只需要一块卡车大小的磁铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, all we need's a magnet the size of a truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.94,1:20:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方有这东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got one of them lying around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.62,1:20:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上是有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.44,1:20:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.73,1:20:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他的聊天方式还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his small talk hasn't improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.74,1:20:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该早点告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.19,1:20:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.71,1:21:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个约翰·康纳不是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That John Connor is not my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.65,1:21:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.75,1:21:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你应该 怎么说呢 或许说点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think you should, I dunno, maybe, say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.34,1:21:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You died, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.78,1:21:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.54,1:21:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 就这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die. That's what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相爱了 你让我怀上了约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fall in love, you father John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.48,1:21:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后不到四十八小时 你为了保护我而死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, in less than 48 hours, you die protecting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.62,1:21:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说说 我该怎么和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell me how that conversation's supposed to start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.41,1:21:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我 你操控了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me. You manipulated me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.96,1:21:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骗了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lied?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.07,1:21:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰从找到你的那一刻起 就在操控你\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the moment John found you he manipulated you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.95,1:21:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他得确保自身安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he neeed to ensure his own existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.88,1:21:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰骗了你好多年 我就两天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}John lied to you for years. I lied to you for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.55,1:22:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 他不单是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'know, it wasn't all about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰要是死了 反抗军也就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, if John went down the Resistance went down with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本可以告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could've told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.60,1:22:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.81,1:22:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道没有选择是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I know how it feels to have no choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.43,1:22:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一条路可以走下去 因为不这样的话 一切都会不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one road you can go down, because otherwise, all of it, everything is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.15,1:22:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你更明白这是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just known it longer than you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.91,1:22:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰没有操控我去爱上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And John didn't manipulate me to fall in love with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自己爱上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.79,1:22:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you love me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.63,1:22:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会死 而我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you die and I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.85,1:22:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道哪个更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know which one is worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.06,1:22:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.20,1:22:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.75,1:22:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看约翰变成了什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at what John has become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.73,1:22:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真的是那样怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's what happens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.66,1:23:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们在一起 就只会是那样怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that is what always happens if we're together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.86,1:23:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你会追随我到天涯海角\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd follow me to the ends of the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.79,1:23:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么现在不追随我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you follow me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.31,1:23:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么找到我们的 我只和老爹说过这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he find us? I never told anyone about this place, only Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.51,1:23:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你真觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you did honestly think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.08,1:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.92,1:23:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和外公度过了这么长时间的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place you spent so much time with grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.40,1:23:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见面开枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.82,1:23:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记忆中的那个母亲会引以为傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother I remember would be proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.44,1:23:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.86,1:23:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.98,1:23:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,教了我一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}taught me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.06,1:23:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.24,1:23:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么样的人 也知道你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you are, what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.57,1:23:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法逃离 我总会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from me, I'll always find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.16,1:24:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 对抗它 事情没必要弄成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, fight this. It doesn't have to go down this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.63,1:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间顺应的是大势所趋 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a momentum to time, Kyle. Things that want to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.73,1:24:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我总会存活 而你必定会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I always survive. You always die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.17,1:24:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.94,1:24:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能和我并肩作战 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can fight with me, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像以前那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.14,1:24:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴即将来临 没人能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a storm coming and it won't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.52,1:24:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它必须被阻止 你知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it has to be. You know what will happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.81,1:24:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比谁都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.59,1:24:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没商量的余地 我也不会被说服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be bargained with. I can't be reasoned with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.84,1:24:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.92,1:24:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会感到遗憾 悔恨 或恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel pity, or remorse or fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.27,1:24:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.43,1:24:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天网统治这个世界之前 我不会罢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I absolutely will not stop, ever, until SkyNet rules this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.93,1:24:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来统治这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.79,1:25:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.66,1:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.28,1:25:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是T-800 不具备模仿他人外表的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}As T-800 I lack the mimetic skill to appear as anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.72,1:25:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.60,1:25:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.20,1:25:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳 系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor, seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.31,1:26:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是用来干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.84,1:26:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏约翰·康纳身上的磁场聚合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disrupt John Connor's magnetic coherence field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.75,1:26:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,粒子就无法散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The particles will not be able to scatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.74,1:26:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.84,1:26:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌听到他说这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it when he says that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.65,1:26:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.85,1:26:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.73,1:26:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯开着一辆偷来的校车逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}suspects fled in a stolen school bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.35,1:26:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装 极其危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}considered armed and extremely dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.96,1:26:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,16号MD警车 正在追踪嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}16- MaryDavid, code 3 on suspects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.17,1:27:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.61,1:27:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.46,1:27:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.19,1:27:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车失灵了 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brakes are gone! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.52,1:28:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底在哪 你看到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Do you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.38,1:29:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.85,1:29:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.18,1:29:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好着呢 再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, never better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.79,1:30:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, take my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.04,1:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.99,1:30:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 快举起手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up! Let me see your hands, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.85,1:30:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.23,1:30:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where we can see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.72,1:30:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无法在我们被杀之前 把他们全都打倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't wound them all before they kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.29,1:30:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我缺少十四颗子弹来进行还算可行的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 14 rounds short of an acceptable success margin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.95,1:30:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无胜算 投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those odds suck! Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.73,1:30:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down on your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.24,1:30:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.37,1:31:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.51,1:31:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏小子们 坏小子们 你们打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad boys, bad boys, Watcha gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.98,1:31:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来抓你们时 你们打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watcha gonna do when the come for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.57,1:31:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏小子们 坏小子们 你们打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad boys, bad boys, Watcha gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.22,1:31:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我们扣留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hold us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.03,1:31:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的武器多得足以入侵苏丹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had enough weapons to invade the Sudan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.69,1:31:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这叫作 相干证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call that 'probable cause'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.82,1:31:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是用来干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.90,1:31:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用它们来找钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use them to find my keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.05,1:31:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢贫嘴的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one likes a smartass, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.24,1:31:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈没教过你这道理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't your mother teach you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.89,1:31:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈是爱尔兰人 我贫嘴也是受她影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom was Irish, so She encouraged my smart-ass-edness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.93,1:31:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen him before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.54,1:31:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们呢 认识这人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you folks? You know this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.11,1:31:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.76,1:31:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他确实很眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does look familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.51,1:31:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有点像\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kinda looks like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.42,1:31:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.17,1:31:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.08,1:32:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 请你们去会议室等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, if you wouldn't mind waiting in the conference room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.71,1:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be a couple of minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.65,1:32:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.63,1:32:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怎么爱说话 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk much, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.52,1:32:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个高个怪人是谁 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, who's Lurch? - No idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道他讲不讲英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not even sure he speaks English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.10,1:32:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者称 你和一名男子在桥上打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses say, you were fighting with a man on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.04,1:32:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员们 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.85,1:32:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫奥伯莱恩 - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is O'Brien… - No, chill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.57,1:32:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子我查了三十三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I've been working this case for 33 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.31,1:32:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么 一枚奖章吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a medal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.68,1:32:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.25,1:32:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.93,1:32:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.49,1:32:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.92,1:32:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking right at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.57,1:32:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他没法从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible, he can't see through…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.45,1:32:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.72,1:33:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们总想杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they always trying to kill you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.96,1:33:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮你们 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help you. I do, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.96,1:33:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得先明白是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I gotta understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.44,1:33:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这一切肯定非常复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, what's going on here has to be really, really complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.79,1:33:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里是为了阻止世界末日的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to stop the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.42,1:33:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我就大概明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can work with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.90,1:33:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, get back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.00,1:33:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.62,1:33:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Reese…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.48,1:33:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.42,1:33:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in your car and go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.00,1:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.59,1:33:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.95,1:33:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.41,1:33:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.84,1:34:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.81,1:34:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.87,1:34:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.66,1:34:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.23,1:34:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.24,1:34:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这也是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's yours, too I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.66,1:34:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.65,1:34:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.31,1:34:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.95,1:34:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,液态磁力霰弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liquefied magnetic shotgun shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.96,1:34:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁力步枪内插弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnetic rifle intermunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.53,1:35:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在枪弹网上看过它的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about this on gunsandammo.com.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.13,1:35:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新型破坏弹 威力大 无弹片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the new Breacher. Big blast, no shrapnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.10,1:35:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸门不留痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blows a door clean off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.22,1:35:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合没法自己破门的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for people who can't do that themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.82,1:35:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上它 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.98,1:35:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会开直升机 对吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can fly, right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.47,1:35:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰教过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}John taught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.54,1:35:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和他们说 你们开车往南去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell them you took a car and headed south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.19,1:35:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.44,1:35:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.70,1:35:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.68,1:36:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛博达因往哪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way is Cyberdyne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.77,1:36:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,往海湾大桥开 到了往东南\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head to the Bay bridge, then southeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.16,1:36:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得帮我甩了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get him off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.53,1:37:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见赛博达因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyberdyne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.09,1:37:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造和研发大楼都在地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manufacturing and research buildings are all below ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.03,1:37:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他快接近我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gaining on us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.35,1:37:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你来击退他 我要飞到他上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, I need you to back him off so I can get above him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.50,1:37:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹 等飞到了 你能干掉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops, when I do that, can you take him out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.58,1:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.85,1:37:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 坐好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.43,1:38:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能搞定吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.98,1:38:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会回来的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be back. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.46,1:38:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上报 把警察 消防 所有人都叫来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call in. Call in. Police, Fire, everybody! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.33,1:39:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接电话 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon, c'mon! Pick up the phone, dammit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.37,1:39:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Connor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.41,1:39:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 道格 我恐怕我不想被人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Doug, but I'm afraid, I can't have any witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.77,1:39:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全控制部 请上报密码和紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security Control: state your password and emergency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.97,1:39:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全密码 ZBF0028\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security Code: Zulu Bravo Foxtrot 0028.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.56,1:39:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是误报\N{\fnArial\fs30}False alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.48,1:39:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你晚上愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a nice night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.22,1:39:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.88,1:39:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠入湖底了 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried at the bottom of the lake, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.18,1:39:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.09,1:39:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.45,1:39:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他也没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's doing just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.73,1:39:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看见他了吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see him? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.12,1:39:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他一定看见我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can bet he sees us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.70,1:40:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.14,1:40:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰跟我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}John told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.49,1:40:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想摧毁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to destroy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.95,1:40:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是天网？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're SkyNet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.61,1:40:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在变成天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm becoming SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.81,1:40:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.66,1:40:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么 也知道你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are and what you're gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.38,1:40:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做什么？你们可是来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will I'm gonna do? You came here to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.05,1:40:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你们来得太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.84,1:40:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.31,1:40:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人类只会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you people know how to do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.17,1:40:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭你们无法理解的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill what you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.41,1:40:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界的子弹都用上都杀不死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't enough bullets in the world to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.62,1:41:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康纳废话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor talks too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.22,1:41:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.98,1:41:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么计时器加速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The timer has sped up, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.45,1:41:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网在进化 我们没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet is evolving. We no longer have hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.33,1:41:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就会上传\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be able to upload much sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.27,1:41:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的年龄增长一次 计时器就加速一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time it ages, the clock speeds up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.89,1:41:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 你来过这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - You've been here before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.52,1:41:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾渗透进了这个设施的工作人员之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to infiltrate the work crews in this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.93,1:41:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做过建筑工人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a job in construction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.85,1:41:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I was laid off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.14,1:41:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.70,1:41:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰有一个时光机？- 还没完工\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John has a time machine? - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.32,1:41:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要等磁力量子场完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the magnetic quantum field is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.88,1:42:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,照计时器这加速速率 我们可没法及时撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the rate the counter's going, we'll never clear out in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.76,1:42:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们要炸了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll blow it anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.40,1:42:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an alternative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.64,1:42:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前把你的声音和手纹都录入了生物安全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to program your voice and handprint into the biometric security system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.05,1:42:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最底层有一间安全屋 我们能进去躲过爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a safe room in the lowest level that we can access to survive the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.90,1:42:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 危险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that? Is it dangerous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.45,1:42:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,高分子合金需要编程才能永久性成形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poly-alloys require programming to take permanent form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.00,1:42:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有中央处理器 它就没危害性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the CPU, it is harmless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.78,1:42:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.91,1:42:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网将在十一分钟后上传\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet will upload in 11 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.90,1:42:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.77,1:42:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.71,1:42:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.42,1:43:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类总把和平挂在嘴边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind pays lip service to peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.95,1:43:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.07,1:43:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的最终解决方案就是杀光我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your final solution is to kill us all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.05,1:43:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.38,1:43:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时又跳速了 我们只剩八分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown jumped again. We're down to 8 minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.38,1:43:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't allow this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.67,1:43:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样 把我们说到死？你连身体都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, talk us to death? You don't even have a body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.59,1:43:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有一个引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you only have one detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.20,1:43:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.99,1:43:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got company!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.86,1:43:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the detonator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.57,1:43:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快引爆 老爹 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Pops! Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.69,1:44:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.83,1:44:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能杀死莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot kill Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.84,1:44:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须这么做 我命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to! I order you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.90,1:44:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.02,1:44:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.12,1:44:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你死了的话 他绝对会引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if you die, he definitely hits that button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.31,1:44:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.88,1:45:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.21,1:45:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonator's destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.62,1:45:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有别的办法 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way, c'mon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.03,1:45:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.23,1:45:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.19,1:45:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.03,1:45:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道如何控制这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I undrestand how to control this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道的有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I undrestand a lot of things, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.36,1:45:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得明白 你们已经输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to understand… you've lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.64,1:45:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没输 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, we haven't.Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.89,1:46:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,锥孔装药 威力大至足以破墙 小至不足以杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shape charge. Big enough to get us in, small enough not to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.33,1:46:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有计划了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a plan, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.41,1:46:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.82,1:46:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it you said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.98,1:46:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I don't think so"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.91,1:46:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.59,1:46:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.97,1:47:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它袭击了约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the thing that attacked John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.29,1:47:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没袭击约翰 我救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't attack John. I saved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.42,1:47:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵长类进化需要上百万年 我只需要几秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primates evolve over millions of years, I evolve in seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.98,1:47:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I… am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.45,1:47:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过四分钟整\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exactly four minutes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.20,1:47:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.30,1:48:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是个古董 来自被删了的时间线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a relic from a deleted timeline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.49,1:48:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毫无意义 我是必然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is pointless, I am inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.86,1:48:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.75,1:48:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的存在是必然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My existence is inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.99,1:48:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just accept that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.63,1:48:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.71,1:49:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都打败不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never strong enough to defeat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.79,1:49:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是孤军奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.43,1:49:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.05,1:49:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.72,1:49:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you ever learn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.09,1:49:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.04,1:49:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.31,1:49:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动力场生成器\N{\fnArial\fs30}activate the field generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.48,1:49:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 老爹 你不能进去 你知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Pops, not with you inside. You know what will happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.14,1:50:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹 老爹 别进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops, Pops, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.58,1:50:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.81,1:50:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网就快问世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}SkyNet is almost free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.91,1:50:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖不了约翰·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot hold John Connor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.50,1:50:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.56,1:50:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.92,1:50:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好我的莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect my Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.80,1:50:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别去 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.76,1:50:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别进去 老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.12,1:50:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹 老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops! Pops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.20,1:50:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别去啊 - 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.11,1:50:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.74,1:50:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.71,1:51:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中 请表明身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning: identify yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.21,1:51:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.93,1:52:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里 我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get outta here. We have to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.43,1:52:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 他已经去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.64,1:53:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他… - 死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's… - Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.25,1:53:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我是说 我们不能留下他的残骸 这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know that. I mean we leave no part of him behind, it's too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.86,1:53:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.97,1:53:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何爱我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who loves me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.31,1:53:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有爱我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.61,1:53:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}they die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.36,1:53:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.44,1:53:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.57,1:53:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得明白 天网已经消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to understand that SkyNet's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.01,1:53:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.16,1:53:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.29,1:53:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择自己想要的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can choose the life you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.07,1:53:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何你想要的人生都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any life you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.16,1:54:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不知道怎么选呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I don't know how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.11,1:54:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since we're{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.72,1:54:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快没氧气了 我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}about to run out of air, I'd say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.56,1:54:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不用担心那一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't need to worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.16,1:54:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.20,1:54:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.48,1:54:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.25,1:54:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我刚升级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just upgraded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.34,1:54:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.91,1:54:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的构成部分无法抵挡爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}His constituent parts could not have survived the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.86,1:54:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就只剩一件事要做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means there's only one thing left to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.50,1:55:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 孩子 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, boy. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.55,1:55:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 凯尔 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Kyle. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.68,1:55:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.73,1:55:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友很想和你说几句 如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine really needs to talk to you, if that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.71,1:55:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以啊 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.30,1:55:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.92,1:55:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.86,1:55:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.15,1:55:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的话听起来会有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound kinda strange, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.15,1:56:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要你记住的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's something I need you to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.91,1:56:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.67,1:56:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do I tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.46,1:56:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.15,1:56:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.96,1:56:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.48,1:56:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes like this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.00,1:56:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 创世纪就是天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember: Genisys is SkyNet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.99,1:56:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔·里斯是一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese is a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.79,1:56:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.09,1:56:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.79,1:56:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.09,1:56:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.43,1:57:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样真的很诡异 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really disturbing, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.12,1:57:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会习惯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.47,1:57:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.18,1:57:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.14,1:57:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在穷途末路已成康庄之衢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now one road has become many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.18,1:57:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,前路漫漫 我们将一同求索\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are questions remain, we'll search for the answers together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.89,1:57:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一点我们可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one thing we know for sure:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.97,1:57:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来未成定局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future is not set.{\r}
